{0E}*      Safety check! One, two, Konnu!      *
*   Mind your head! Three, four, Konnu!    *
*  Mind the water level when discharging   *{0F}{w}

'Incident Report of Koreapper, Reservoir Guard'{w}{p}'I, Koreapper, charged with guarding the reservoir, have lost the key to the reservoir pump.'{w}{p}--Why did you lose it?{w}{p}'It seems I dropped it somewhere while making my rounds. I am terribly sorry.'{w}{p}--Where did you lose it?{w}{p}'Well... I was short on sleep, so I don't remember last night very well.'{w}{p}--Stayed up late, did you?{w}{p}'Yes.'{w}{p}--Doing what?{w}{p}'Huh? ...Oh, this and that.'{w}{p}--No hiding. Be specific.{w}{p}'W-well, it doesn't really matter what, does it?'{w}{p}--I hear you borrowed the new one from Ildam.{w}{p}'*gulp*!?'{w}{p}--You borrowed it, I hear?{w}{p}'...Yes. That's what did it.'{w}{p}--So how was it?{w}{p}'Oh, it was just... hee hee hee...'{w}{p}--Lend it to me next!{w}{p}'Ehh, should I? I dunno~'{w}{p}--I'll throw you in jail, y'know?{w}{p}'W-wait, please!
All right, all right,
I'll lend it to you the day after tomorrow!!'{w}{p}After that, a largely pointless exchange went on and on in the record.{w}

{0E}"GYAAAH! He-e-elp me-e-e-e!
Ooh! Passing by over there -- it's Master!{0F}
I'm Tarrit, by the way... wait, did I say that already?"{w}
